<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's bourse closed on Labour Day.</title>
<headline>Morocco's bourse closed on Labour Day.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Casablanca stock exchange closed on Thursday due to Labour Day, which is a public holiday in Morocco. All public offices and private banks are also closed.</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 72 65 18</p>
</text>
